Z||000007||chris6878||12-13-1999||12:59 PM||||Go For it...<P>I recently purchased an 85 Gt for $500 my self.. It has a perfect body, (needs new paint) but the motor was knocking..    i put about $300 in the motor and rebuild it with new crank, cam, bearings(rod, main, cam), lifters,timing gear and chain, and all new gaskets..   she runs good and i just have a net total of $800 in the car now..  not bad..      If u think the car was worth it and had a little money to spend on the engine, then i would grab it...      <P>chris||||reg||5
